            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akumbali kubambene acaabilo ca-Juda, kuzwa kujwe kusikila kumbo, nkokuyooba caabilo cisalala ncemuyoopa Leza; bwaamba bwaco buyooba tukokola tuli zyuulu zili makumi obile amusanu; abulamfu bwaco buyooba mbubonya mbuli zyaabilo zimwi, kuzwa kujwe kusikila kumbo. Abusena busalalisya buyooba mukati kaco, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mweenya uusalala ngumupaizya Jehova uyooba abulamfu bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zili makumi obile amusanu abwaamba bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zili makumi obile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi mweenya uusalala uleelede kwaabwa obo, Bapaizi bayoopegwa caabilo cijisi bulamfu bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zili makumi obile amusanu kulubazu lwakunyika, abwaamba bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zili ikumi kulubazu lwakumbo, abwaamba bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zili ikumi kulubazu lwakujwe, abulamfu bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zili makumi obile amusanu kulubazu lwakumusanza, Acikombelo ca-Jehova ciyooba akati kaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
