            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nyika iicisyeede, iili abwaamba bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zyosanwe abulamfu bwatukokola tuli makumi obile amusanu, iyooba yabantu buyo. Iyooba yamunzi, ube azikalilo amyuunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njeeyi myeelwe yayo. Lubazu lwakunyika luyooba tukokola tuli zyuulu zyone amyaanda yosanwe, lubazu lwakumusanza luyooba tukokola tuli zyuulu zyone amyaanda yosanwe, lubazu lwakujwe luyooba tukokola tuli zyuulu zyone amyaanda yosanwe, alubazu lwakumbo luyooba tukokola tuli zyuulu zyone amyaanda yosanwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi munzi uyoozyungulukwa lubuwa: kulubazu lwakunyika tukokola tuli myanda yobile amakumi osanwe, kumusanza tukokola tuli myanda yobile amakumi osanwe, kujwe tukokola tuli myanda yobile amakumi osanwe, akumbo tukokola tuli myanda yobile amakumi osanwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulamfu busyeede kumbali lyamweenya uusalala buyooba tukokola tuli zyuulu zili ikumi kujwe atukokola tuli zyuulu zili ikumi kumbo. Eyi nyika iyooba kumbali lyamweenya uusalala, nkabela micelo yayo iyooba zilyo zyabasimilimo bamumunzi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ciy 7:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basimilimo bamumunzi bamisyobo yoonse yaba-Israyeli mbobeelede kwiilima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
