        {
          "text": "Lino nyika iisyeede, kumabazu oonse obile aacaabilo cisalala anyika yamunzi, iyooba yasilutwe wacisi. Kuzwa kubwaamba bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zili makumi obile amusanu bwacaabilo cisalala kusikila kumugaano wakujwe, akuzwa kubwaamba bwakumbo bwatukokola tuli zyuulu zili makumi obile amusanu kusikila kumugaano wakumbo, nyika iibambene azyaabilo zyamisyobo, yoonse iyooba yasilutwe wacisi. Acaabilo cisalala acikombelo ziyooba akatikati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
