              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwalo kulubazu lwakumusanza bulamfu buyooba tukokola tuli zyuulu zyone amyarida yosanwe, amilyango iyooba itatu: mulyango wa-Simeoni, mulyango wa-Isakara amulyango wa-Zebuloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
